OL,5,G2100 The Chase Around the World
OL,6,     FThe teams land in Paris to take on
OL,7,     Fthe Vixen and the Beast. They set
OL,8,     Fa series of quiz questions that
OL,9,     Fthe players must solve to navigate
OL,10,     Facross the city and find Bradley
OL,11,     FWalsh at the finish line. The
OL,12,     Ffirst challenge is a quiz on an
OL,13,     Fopen-top bus around the Arc de
OL,14,     FTriomphe. The race across the city
OL,15,     Fforces the teams to navigate their
OL,16,     Fway to the finish line by
OL,17,     Fsuccessfully completing games
OL,18,     Finvolving waxworks, snails, Notre
OL,19,     FDame, and a captive music quiz in
OL,20,     Fthe back of a taxi
